		{
			dependencies: ["684EFEC23F5DBE26"]
			description: ["This beast of a worm hides in the desert sands, waiting for something to walk by so it can attack it. It sits, frozen in place, then it burrows out and surprise attacks its prey. It can shoot acidic spit which is a feature of its nuclear ancestors. See, long ago, this species lived in the toxic caves, either swimming in the acid, or biting through solid radrock. 99% of all toxic caves were eradicated and evaporated due to a hellish fragment containing a bioweapon that kills radioactive material. It ended up here, dried out, but still alive and evolved."]
